    "show_share": true,
    "description": "As a child, Winnie Kinyanjui saw nurses in white uniforms walking around the hospital near her home. Winnie found them fascinating, sparking a dream that she would eventually pursue. A high school experience where she assisted a fellow student during childbirth cemented this dream further. That said, a diploma in nursing was not enough; she chose to apply to AKU-SONAM EA for the Bachelor of Science in Nursing upgrading programme.",
